2 E<sub>2</sub><sup>°</sup></span>, d'où <span class=\"m\">E<sup>°</sup></span>(<span class=\"ce\">MnO<sub>4</sub><sup>−</sup></span>/<span class=\"ce\">MnO<sub>2</sub></span>) <span class=\"m\">=</span> <span class=\"m\">1,70 V</span></li><li><span class=\"num\">19</span> les enthalpies libres <span class=\"m\">−nFE<sup>°</sup></span> s'ajoutent : <span class=\"m\">2 E<sup>°</sup>=4 E<sub>1</sub><sup>°</sup>−2 E<sub>2</sub><sup>°</sup></span>, d'où <span class=\"m\">E<sup>°</sup></span>(<span class=\"ce\">O<sub>2</sub></span>/<span class=\"ce\">H<sub>2</sub>O<sub>2</sub></span>) <span class=\"m\">=</span> <span class=\"m\">0,680 V</span></li><li><span class=\"num\">20</span> les enthalpies libres <span class=\"m\">−nFE<sup>°</sup></span> s'ajoutent : <span class=\"m\">3 E<sup>°</sup>=1 E<sub>1</sub><sup>°</sup>−2 E<sub>2</sub><sup>°</sup></span>, d'où <span class=\"m\">E<sup>°</sup></span>(<span class=\"ce\">Cr<sup>3<sup>+</sup></sup></span>/<span class=\"ce\">Cr</span>) <span class=\"m\">=</span> <span class=\"m\">0,470 V</span></li><li><span class=\"num\">21</span> les enthalpies libres <span class=\"m\">−nFE<sup>°</sup></span> s'ajoutent : <span class=\"m\">1 E<sup>°</sup>=2 E<sub>1</sub><sup>°</sup>−1 E<sub>2</sub><sup>°</sup></span>, d'où <span class=\"m\">E<sup>°</sup></span>(<span class=\"ce\">Hg<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span>/<span class=\"ce\">Hg<sub>2</sub><sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span>) <span class=\"m\">=</span> <span class=\"m\">0,900 V</span></li><li><span class=\"num\">22</span> les enthalpies libres <span class=\"m\">−nFE<sup>°</sup></span> s'ajoutent : <span class=\"m\">1 E<sup>°</sup>=2 E<sub>1</sub><sup>°</sup>−1 E<sub>2</sub><sup>°</sup></span>, d'où <span class=\"m\">E<sup>°</sup></span>(<span class=\"ce\">Cu<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span>/<span class=\"ce\">Cu<sup><sup>+</sup></sup></span>) <span class=\"m\">=</span> <span class=\"m\">0,160 V</span></li></ul> ","meca":[]},{"n":3,"titre":"Énergie fournie par une pile","diff":1,"enonce":"<p cla