/span> Réaction entre <span class=\"ce\">Cu<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span> et <span class=\"ce\">S<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub><sup>2−</sup></span> ; <span class=\"m\">E<sup>°</sup></span>(<span class=\"ce\">Cu<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span>/<span class=\"ce\">Cu</span>) = 0,34 V, <span class=\"m\">E<sup>°</sup></span>(<span class=\"ce\">S<sub>4</sub>O<sub>6</sub><sup>2−</sup></span>/<span class=\"ce\">S<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub><sup>2−</sup></span>) = 0,09 V.</li><li><span class=\"num\">34</span> Réaction entre <span class=\"ce\">Ce<sup>4<sup>+</sup></sup></span> et <span class=\"ce\">NO<sub>2</sub></span> ; <span class=\"m\">E<sup>°</sup></span>(<span class=\"ce\">Ce<sup>4<sup>+</sup></sup></span>/<span class=\"ce\">Ce<sup>3<sup>+</sup></sup></span>) = 1,72 V, <span class=\"m\">E<sup>°</sup></span>(<span class=\"ce\">NO<sub>3</sub><sup>−</sup></span>/<span class=\"ce\">NO<sub>2</sub></span>) = 0,80 V.</li><li><span class=\"num\">35</span> Réaction entre <span class=\"ce\">NO<sub>3</sub><sup>−</sup></span> et <span class=\"ce\">Sn<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span> ; <span class=\"m\">E<sup>°</sup></span>(<span class=\"ce\">NO<sub>3</sub><sup>−</sup></span>/<span class=\"ce\">NO<sub>2</sub></span>) = 0,80 V, <span class=\"m\">E<sup>°</sup></span>(<span class=\"ce\">Sn<sup>4<sup>+</sup></sup></span>/<span class=\"ce\">Sn<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span>) = 0,15 V.</li><li><span class=\"num\">36</span> Réaction entre <span class=\"ce\">NO<sub>3</sub><sup>−</sup></span> et <span class=\"ce\">Pb</span> ; <span class=\"m\">E<sup>°</sup></span>(<span class=\"ce\">NO<sub>3</sub><sup>−</sup></span>/<span class=\"ce\">NO</span>) = 0,96 V, <span class=\"m\">E<sup>°</sup></span>(<span class=\"ce\">Pb<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span>/<span class=\"ce\">Pb</span>) = -0,13 V.</li><li><span class=\"num\">37</span> Réaction entre <span class=\"ce\">S<sub>4</sub>O<sub>6</sub><sup>2−</sup></span> et <span class=\"ce\">H<sub>2</sub>C<sub>2</sub>O<sub>4</sub></span> ; <span class=\"m\">E<sup>°</su